<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP POOL STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP POOL STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Cup pool standings after</p>
<p>Saturday's matches (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>points for, points against, total points):</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p> Pontypridd	 3    3    0    0   79   38    6</p>
<p> Dax		  3    2    0    1  119   51    4</p>
<p> Bath		 3    2    0    1   86   61    4</p>
<p> Treviso	    2    0    0    2   36   62    0</p>
<p> Edinburgh	  3    0    0    3   48  156    0</p>
<p>Pool B</p>
<p> Leicester	  3    3    0    0   89   27    6</p>
<p> Llanelli	   3    2    0    1   81   56    4</p>
<p> Pau		  3    1    0    2  114   78    2</p>
<p> Leinster	   3    1    0    2   61   86    2</p>
<p> Scottish Borders 4    1    0    3   80  178    2</p>
<p>Pool C</p>
<p> Harlequins	 2    2    0    0   65   37    4</p>
<p> Brive		2    2    0    0   66   49    4</p>
<p> Neath		4    2    0    2   83  109    4</p>
<p> Ulster	     3    1    0    2   69   70    2</p>
<p> Caledonia	  3    0    0    3   82  100    0</p>
<p>Pool D</p>
<p> Cardiff	    3    2    0    1   94   78    4</p>
<p> Munster	    3    2    0    1   90   70    4</p>
<p> Toulouse	   3    2    0    1   97  123    4</p>
<p> Wasps		3    1    0    2  123   92    2</p>
<p> Milan		2    0    0    2   31   67    0</p>
<p>Remaining fixtures:</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p> Oct 27   Edinburgh v Treviso</p>
<p> Nov 2    Dax v Pontypridd, Treviso v Bath</p>
<p>Pool B</p>
<p> Nov 2    Leicester v Llanelli, Leinster v Pau</p>
<p>Pool C</p>
<p> Oct 27   Brive v Harlequins,</p>
<p> Nov 2    Harlequins v Caledonia, Ulster v Brive</p>
<p>Pool D</p>
<p> Oct 27   Cardiff v Milan</p>
<p> Nov 2    Toulouse v Munster, Milan v Wasps</p>
<p>Quarter-finals: November 16-17</p>
<p>Semifinals: January 4-5, 1997</p>
<p>Final: Date/venue to be announced.</p>
